@Logic
script MysteryUILogic extends Logic

	-- 물음표 사건 화면 (MysteryUI.ui): 판 상태가 MYSTERY일 때 열린다. 받는다 / 지나친다.
	property string RootPath = "/ui/MysteryUI"

	@HideFromInspector
	property table handlers = {}

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void OnBeginPlay()
		-- 버튼 연결, 화면 숨기기.
		self.handlers = {}
		self:Bind("Win/Accept", true)
		self:Bind("Win/Skip", false)
		self._T.shown = nil
		self._T.seq = -1
		self:Show(false)
		log("[VRF] MysteryUILogic begin")
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void Bind(string sub, boolean accept)
		-- 버튼 클릭 → 서버에 선택 전달.
		local e = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath(self.RootPath .. "/" .. sub)
		if not isvalid(e) then return end
		local h = e:ConnectEvent(ButtonClickEvent, function()
			_UISoundLogic:PlayClick()
			local mgr = self:GetManager()
			if mgr ~= nil and mgr.RunState == "MYSTERY" then mgr:RequestMystery(accept) end
		end)
		table.insert(self.handlers, { e = e, h = h })
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void OnEndPlay()
		-- 버튼 연결 해제.
		for _, r in ipairs(self.handlers) do
			if isvalid(r.e) then r.e:DisconnectEvent(ButtonClickEvent, r.h) end
		end
		self.handlers = {}
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method Component GetManager()
		-- 현재 맵의 판 진행 매니저.
		local player = _UserService.LocalPlayer
		if not isvalid(player) or not isvalid(player.CurrentMap) then return nil end
		return player.CurrentMap:GetComponent("script.TowerRunManager")
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void Show(boolean on)
		-- 화면 켜기/끄기.
		if self._T.shown == on then return end
		self._T.shown = on
		for _, n in ipairs({ "Dim", "Win" }) do
			local e = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath(self.RootPath .. "/" .. n)
			if isvalid(e) then e:SetEnable(on) end
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void OnUpdate(number delta)
		-- 물음표 상태에서만 보이고, 사건이 바뀌면 글을 채운다 (첫 줄 = 제목).
		local mgr = self:GetManager()
		local on = mgr ~= nil and mgr.RunState == "MYSTERY"
		self:Show(on)
		if not on or self._T.seq == mgr.MysterySeq then return end
		self._T.seq = mgr.MysterySeq
		local raw = string.gsub(mgr.MysteryText, "\\n", "\n")
		local title, body = string.match(raw, "^([^\n]*)\n(.*)$")
		local t = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath(self.RootPath .. "/Win/Title")
		local b = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath(self.RootPath .. "/Win/Body/Text")
		if isvalid(t) then t.TextGUIRendererComponent.Text = title or "물음표" end
		if isvalid(b) then b.TextGUIRendererComponent.Text = body or raw end
	end

end
